{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a brand-new, responsive Shopify section for the Calm Nights product page.
    
    Place it directly after the “Why Calm Nights Feels Different” section and before the “Inside Calm Nights” section.
    
    The design should feel visually alive, premium, calming, and sleep-themed. Do not create a plain timeline with basic circles or dots.
    
    Section heading
    
    What to Expect With Consistent Use
    
    Supporting text
    
    Calm Nights supports your body’s natural sleep process. Here’s what consistent nightly use may feel like.
    
    Three-Step Experience
    
    Create three visually engaging cards connected as a timeline.
    
    Card 1
    
    Title: Your First Few Nights
    
    Description:
    A calmer wind-down and an easier transition into sleep.
    
    Default visual:
    A crescent moon with small stars.
    
    Card 2
    
    Title: After 1–2 Weeks
    
    Description:
    Your nighttime routine may begin feeling more consistent and restful.
    
    Default visual:
    A glowing star or moon surrounded by stars.
    
    Card 3
    
    Title: Around 30 Days
    
    Description:
    More consistent nights may support clearer, more refreshed mornings.
    
    Default visual:
    A sunrise or glowing morning sky.
    
    Visual Design
    Use three individual cards rather than a basic dot timeline.
    Display the cards horizontally across three columns on desktop.
    Stack the cards vertically on mobile.
    Connect the cards with a thin, curved or softly glowing purple line.
    Use Ariya purple #7D45C6 as the main accent color.
    Use black for headings and body text.
    Use a white or very light lavender background.
    Add subtle stars, moon shapes, soft glows, or night-sky details around the section.
    Give each card a soft lavender tint, subtle shadow, or light purple border.
    Keep the design elegant and uncluttered.
    Make the icons large enough to become a noticeable visual element.
    Keep the section compact and avoid excessive empty space.
    Do not use basic numbered circles or plain timeline dots.
    Custom Images and Icons
    
    Add an image-upload setting for each card so I can replace the default visual with my own image or illustrated icon.
    
    Provide separate controls for:
    
    Card 1 image
    Card 2 image
    Card 3 image
    Image size on desktop
    Image size on mobile
    Image-to-title spacing
    
    Keep all three uploaded images consistently sized and properly centered.
    
    Subtle Animation
    
    Add an animation on/off toggle.
    
    When animation is enabled:
    
    Allow the small stars to gently twinkle.
    Give the moon and sunrise visuals a subtle glow.
    Make each card softly fade upward as it enters the screen.
    Animate the connecting line as the shopper scrolls through the section.
    Use slow, smooth movement that feels calming.
    
    Do not use fast, spinning, bouncing, flashing, or distracting animations. Ensure animations do not negatively affect page speed.
    
    Disclaimer
    
    Add this small text underneath the cards:
    
    Everyone responds differently. For best results, take two capsules consistently 30–60 minutes before bed.
    
    Keep the disclaimer centered, subtle, and easy to read.
    
    Customization Settings
    
    Provide editable settings for:
    
    Content
    Section heading
    Supporting text
    Each card title
    Each card description
    Disclaimer text
    Image upload for each card
    Typography
    Heading size on desktop
    Heading size on mobile
    Supporting-text size
    Card-title size on desktop
    Card-title size on mobile
    Description size on desktop
    Description size on mobile
    Font weight
    Disclaimer size
    Colors and Styling
    Section background color
    Card background color
    Card border color
    Accent color
    Heading color
    Body-text color
    Connecting-line color
    Card border radius
    Card shadow strength
    Sizing and Spacing
    Image size on desktop
    Image size on mobile
    Card spacing on desktop
    Card spacing on mobile
    Image-to-title spacing
    Title-to-description spacing
    Top padding
    Bottom padding
    Side padding
    Maximum desktop width
    Animation
    Animation on/off
    Star twinkle on/off
    Icon glow on/off
    Scroll fade animation on/off
    Connecting-line animation on/off
    
    Make the entire section mobile-first, responsive, visually balanced, and consistent with the premium Ariya Supplements brand., make the images bigger
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-calm-timeline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_background_color }};
    padding: {{ block.settings.padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.padding_side }}px {{ block.settings.padding_bottom }}px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .ai-calm-timeline-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.max_desktop_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-calm-timeline-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }

  .ai-calm-timeline-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_desktop }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 16px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.font_weight }};
  }

  .ai-calm-timeline-subtext-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.supporting_text_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.body_text_color }};
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .ai-calm-timeline-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_spacing_desktop }}px;
    position: relative;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }

  .ai-calm-timeline-connector-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: {{ block.settings.image_size_desktop | divided_by: 2 }}px;
    left: 16.66%;
    right: 16.66%;
    height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(to right, {{ block.settings.connecting_line_color }}, {{ block.settings.accent_color }}, {{ block.settings.connecting_line_color }});
    z-index: 1;
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  {% if block.settings.enable_animation and block.settings.enable_line_animation %}
    .ai-calm-timeline-connector-{{ ai_gen_id }}::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      width: 0;
      height: 100%;
      background: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
      animation: ai-calm-line-grow-{{ ai_gen_id }} 2s ease-out forwards;
      animation-delay: 0.5s;
    }

    @keyframes ai-calm-line-grow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      to {
        width: 100%;
      }
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-calm-timeline-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background-color: {{ block.settings.card_background_color }};
    border: 1px solid {{ block.settings.card_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_border_radius }}px;
    padding: 32px 24px;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    {% if block.settings.card_shadow_strength > 0 %}
      box-shadow: 0 {{ block.settings.card_shadow_strength }}px {{ block.settings.card_shadow_strength | times: 2 }}px rgba(125, 69, 198, {{ block.settings.card_shadow_strength | times: 0.01 }});
    {% endif %}
    transition: transform 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
  }

  {% if block.settings.enable_animation and block.settings.enable_scroll_fade %}
    .ai-calm-timeline-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(30px);
      animation: ai-calm-fade-up-{{ ai_gen_id }} 0.8s ease-out forwards;
    }

    .ai-calm-timeline-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(1) {
      animation-delay: 0.2s;
    }

    .ai-calm-timeline-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(2) {
      animation-delay: 0.4s;
    }

    .ai-calm-timeline-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(3) {
      animation-delay: 0.6s;
    }

    @keyframes ai-calm-fade-up-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-calm-timeline-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    transform: translateY(-4px);
    {% if block.settings.card_shadow_strength > 0 %}
      box-shadow: 0 {{ block.settings.card_shadow_strength | times: 1.5 }}px {{ block.settings.card_shadow_strength | times: 3 }}px rgba(125, 69, 198, {{ block.settings.card_shadow_strength | times: 0.015 }});
    {% endif %}
  }

  .ai-calm-timeline-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.image_size_desktop }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.image_size_desktop }}px;
    margin: 0 auto {{ block.settings.image_to_title_spacing }}px;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .ai-calm-timeline-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  {% if block.settings.enable_animation and block.settings.enable_icon_glow %}
    .ai-calm-timeline-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      animation: ai-calm-glow-{{ ai_gen_id }} 3s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes ai-calm-glow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      0%, 100% {
        filter: drop-shadow(0 0 8px {{ block.settings.accent_color }}66);
      }
      50% {
        filter: drop-shadow(0 0 16px {{ block.settings.accent_color }}99);
      }
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-calm-timeline-default-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    color: {{ block.settings.accent_color }};
  }

  .ai-calm-timeline-default-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
  }

  {% if block.settings.enable_animation and block.settings.enable_star_twinkle %}
    .ai-calm-timeline-star-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      animation: ai-calm-twinkle-{{ ai_gen_id }} 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    .ai-calm-timeline-star-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(2) {
      animation-delay: 0.5s;
    }

    .ai-calm-timeline-star-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(3) {
      animation-delay: 1s;
    }

    @keyframes ai-calm-twinkle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      0%, 100% {
        opacity: 0.3;
      }
      50% {
        opacity: 1;
      }
    }
  {% endif %}

  .ai-calm-timeline-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_title_size_desktop }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.title_to_description_spacing }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.font_weight }};
  }

  .ai-calm-timeline-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size_desktop }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.body_text_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-calm-timeline-disclaimer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: {{ block.settings.disclaimer_size }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.body_text_color }};
    opacity: 0.7;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 749px) {
    .ai-calm-timeline-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.heading_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-calm-timeline-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: {{ block.settings.card_spacing_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-calm-timeline-connector-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      display: none;
    }

    .ai-calm-timeline-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      width: {{ block.settings.image_size_mobile }}px;
      height: {{ block.settings.image_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-calm-timeline-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.card_title_size_mobile }}px;
    }

    .ai-calm-timeline-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.description_size_mobile }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<calm-nights-timeline-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-calm-timeline-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-calm-timeline-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    <div class="ai-calm-timeline-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% if block.settings.section_heading != blank %}
        <h2 class="ai-calm-timeline-heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.section_heading }}</h2>
      {% endif %}
      {% if block.settings.supporting_text != blank %}
        <div class="ai-calm-timeline-subtext-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.supporting_text }}</div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="ai-calm-timeline-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      <div class="ai-calm-timeline-connector-{{ ai_gen_id }}"></div>

      <div class="ai-calm-timeline-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-calm-timeline-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.card_1_image %}
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.card_1_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.card_1_title | escape }}"
              loading="lazy"
              width="{{ block.settings.image_size_desktop }}"
              height="{{ block.settings.image_size_desktop }}"
            >
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-calm-timeline-default-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <path d="M50 10 C30 10 20 25 20 40 C20 50 25 58 30 62 L30 75 C30 80 35 85 40 85 L60 85 C65 85 70 80 70 75 L70 62 C75 58 80 50 80 40 C80 25 70 10 50 10 Z" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.3"/>
                <circle cx="35" cy="25" r="2" fill="currentColor" class="ai-calm-timeline-star-{{ ai_gen_id }}"/>
                <circle cx="65" cy="30" r="2" fill="currentColor" class="ai-calm-timeline-star-{{ ai_gen_id }}"/>
                <circle cx="50" cy="20" r="2" fill="currentColor" class="ai-calm-timeline-star-{{ ai_gen_id }}"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <h3 class="ai-calm-timeline-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.card_1_title }}</h3>
        <p class="ai-calm-timeline-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.card_1_description }}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-calm-timeline-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-calm-timeline-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.card_2_image %}
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.card_2_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.card_2_title | escape }}"
              loading="lazy"
              width="{{ block.settings.image_size_desktop }}"
              height="{{ block.settings.image_size_desktop }}"
            >
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-calm-timeline-default-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="20" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.4"/>
                <circle cx="30" cy="35" r="3" fill="currentColor" class="ai-calm-timeline-star-{{ ai_gen_id }}"/>
                <circle cx="70" cy="35" r="3" fill="currentColor" class="ai-calm-timeline-star-{{ ai_gen_id }}"/>
                <circle cx="35" cy="65" r="2" fill="currentColor" class="ai-calm-timeline-star-{{ ai_gen_id }}"/>
                <circle cx="65" cy="65" r="2" fill="currentColor" class="ai-calm-timeline-star-{{ ai_gen_id }}"/>
                <circle cx="50" cy="25" r="2" fill="currentColor" class="ai-calm-timeline-star-{{ ai_gen_id }}"/>
                <circle cx="50" cy="75" r="2" fill="currentColor" class="ai-calm-timeline-star-{{ ai_gen_id }}"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <h3 class="ai-calm-timeline-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.card_2_title }}</h3>
        <p class="ai-calm-timeline-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.card_2_description }}</p>
      </div>

      <div class="ai-calm-timeline-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        <div class="ai-calm-timeline-icon-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
          {% if block.settings.card_3_image %}
            <img
              src="{{ block.settings.card_3_image | image_url: width: 600 }}"
              alt="{{ block.settings.card_3_title | escape }}"
              loading="lazy"
              width="{{ block.settings.image_size_desktop }}"
              height="{{ block.settings.image_size_desktop }}"
            >
          {% else %}
            <div class="ai-calm-timeline-default-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 100 100" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <circle cx="50" cy="70" r="25" fill="currentColor" opacity="0.3"/>
                <path d="M30 60 Q50 40 70 60" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" fill="none" opacity="0.5"/>
                <circle cx="25" cy="55" r="2" fill="currentColor" class="ai-calm-timeline-star-{{ ai_gen_id }}"/>
                <circle cx="75" cy="55" r="2" fill="currentColor" class="ai-calm-timeline-star-{{ ai_gen_id }}"/>
                <circle cx="40" cy="45" r="2" fill="currentColor" class="ai-calm-timeline-star-{{ ai_gen_id }}"/>
                <circle cx="60" cy="45" r="2" fill="currentColor" class="ai-calm-timeline-star-{{ ai_gen_id }}"/>
              </svg>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
        <h3 class="ai-calm-timeline-card-title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.card_3_title }}</h3>
        <p class="ai-calm-timeline-card-description-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.card_3_description }}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    {% if block.settings.disclaimer_text != blank %}
      <div class="ai-calm-timeline-disclaimer-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.disclaimer_text }}</div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</calm-nights-timeline-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class CalmNightsTimeline{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        {% if block.settings.enable_animation and block.settings.enable_scroll_fade %}
          this.setupScrollAnimation();
        {% endif %}
      }

      setupScrollAnimation() {
        const cards = this.querySelectorAll('.ai-calm-timeline-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}');
        
        const observer = new IntersectionObserver((entries) => {
          entries.forEach(entry => {
            if (entry.isIntersecting) {
              entry.target.style.animationPlayState = 'running';
            }
          });
        }, {
          threshold: 0.1
        });

        cards.forEach(card => {
          card.style.animationPlayState = 'paused';
          observer.observe(card);
        });
      }
    }

    customElements.define('calm-nights-timeline-{{ ai_gen_id }}', CalmNightsTimeline{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

